From 355549a594cae4280838653827b8026ba23fa3c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Harald Anlauf <anlauf@gmx.de>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 20:46:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fortran: Fix MINLOC/MAXLOC with MASK and BACK=.true.
 [PR127846]

The runtime library templates for MINLOC/MAXLOC did not advance properly
through the array argument when MASK was present and BACK was .true. .

Co-authored-by: Federico Perini <federico.perini@gmail.com>

	PR fortran/127846

